WEBVTT

12:01.789 --> 12:03.207
Aye.

12:05.084 --> 12:08.129
- Why?
- I had no money

12:08.254 --> 12:10.339
and an expensive wife.

12:10.464 --> 12:12.216
And where is she now?

12:12.341 --> 12:14.593
In another place,

12:14.719 --> 12:16.929
with another man.

12:23.227 --> 12:25.313
- Your Grace?
- Yes, my dear?

12:25.896 --> 12:28.024
They call you the last dragon...

12:28.149 --> 12:30.735
They do.
